      "message": "If there are sufficiently many indexed projects+branches, users might want to search within them to see which are indexed. Likewise, any UI displaying a list of indexed projects should likely be paginated for a good user experience.\n\nAdditionally, it might be nice to see an \"indexed status\" as a column on the project branches page (like https://gerrit-review.googlesource.com/admin/repos/gerrit,branches).",
